        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn RT5BD / RT5BI, 11 Inch Heart Tip Mortise Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAcorn Manufacturing is very good at making attractive, rustic hardware that looks as if it could have come off a 150 year old door. The 11 Inch Heart Tip Entrance Door Mortise Locksets has a rough black finish that mimics the texture of naturally weathered iron for a truly authentic-looking old world feel. A mortise lockset, it is for doors 1-3/4\"- 3\" thick. It is available in both single cylinder and dummy cylinder functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"2\" border=0\" class=\"text\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 11 Inch Heart Tip Entrance Door Mortise Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Rough Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Rose Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Rose Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handleset Length: 11”</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handleset Width: 3-3/8”</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handleset Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Knob Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Knob Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" Standard, Optional up to 3\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Stile Width: Recommend 4-1/2” with a 4-1/4” minimum.</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C-Keyway</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ACO-Mortise-Specifications.gif?v=1704354518\" width=\"255\" height=\"273\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Acorn Mortise Lock Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Handleset:</b> Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors it does not latch and does not lock. Blank cylinder and non-functional thumbpiece on the exterior. Non-functional turnpiece on the interior.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> A key operates the deadbolt from the exterior while a thumbturn operates it from the interior. The latch is operated by a knob from the interior and by a thumbpiece from the exterior. Panic Proof: Turning of inside knob will retract both deadbolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe handing actually refers to the mortise lock, rather than the knob. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "11 Inch Heart Tip Entrance Door Mortise Lockset, Acorn RT5BD / RT5BI",
                "description": "Acorn Manufacturing is very good at making attractive, rustic hardware that looks as if it could have come off a 150 year old door. The 11 Inch Heart Tip Entrance Door Mortise Locksets has a rough black finish that mimics the texture of naturally weathered iron for a truly authentic-looking old world feel. A mortise lockset, it is for doors 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick. It is available in both single cylinder and dummy cylinder functions.",
